SUMMARY:Part Closure: PICCADILLY LINE: Saturday 31 October\, from 0100\, 
 and all day Sunday 1 November\, including Friday and Saturday Night Tube\,
  no service on the entire line. Use ELIZABETH LINE services between 
 Central London and Heathrow\, and METROPOLITAN LINE services between 
 Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Replacement bus services operate.
